 "pos": "<p class=\"cap2\"><b>Left hand:</b> on the King’s staff, an octave below middle C. Thumb on A, so G is 2, F 3, E 4, D 5.</p><p class=\"cap2\"><b>My fair la-dy:</b> 5 reaches down from D to C for the last note.</p><p class=\"cap2\"><b>Right hand:</b> knocks on the lid on every rest.</p>",
 "sing_how": "Listen, pointing to each note. Sing it, and knock on every rest. Then the left hand plays it while the right hand knocks.",
